+## For agents
+
+For current stable HTTP client spans, use span kind `CLIENT`. Record the request method as `http.request.method`, the absolute requested URL as `url.full`, and the destination as `server.address` and `server.port`. Add `http.response.status_code` if and only if a response status was received. Preserve the path and query in the complete URL, while applying the documented redaction rules if credentials or sensitive content are present. Do not mix these current names with the historical `http.method`, `http.status_code`, `http.url`, `net.peer.name`, or `net.peer.port` attributes.
+<!-- phase-3-for-agents:end -->
